{"id":"eadd7933-563e-4c66-857a-98c2d375b387","object":"chat.completion","created":1795243714,"model":"deepseek-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"SELECT EXTRACT(MONTH FROM mo.m)::int AS month, ma.mau\nFROM (SELECT generate_series(DATE '2018-01-01', DATE '2018-12-01', INTERVAL '1 month')::date AS m) mo\nLEFT JOIN (\n  SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', o.order_purchase_timestamp)::date AS m,\n         COUNT(DISTINCT c.customer_unique_id) AS mau\n  FROM orders o\n  JOIN customers c ON c.customer_id = o.customer_id\n  WHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled', 'unavailable')\n    AND o.order_purchase_timestamp >= TIMESTAMP '2018-01-01'\n    AND o.order_purchase_timestamp < TIMESTAMP '2019-01-01'\n  GROUP BY 1\n) ma ON ma.m = mo.m\nORDER BY 1\nLIMIT 12;","reasoning_content":"用户要求：2018年按自然月统计有效下单自然人数（MAU），输出全部12个月；无事实月份覆盖，人数保留NULL。\n\n需要生成12个月的日历序列，LEFT JOIN 月度MAU。\n\nMAU: COUNT(DISTINCT c.customer_unique_id)，过滤 o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled','unavailable')，订单时间 order_purchase_timestamp 在2018年对应月。\n\n注意：无事实月份保留NULL（不是0）。用 generate_series 生成12个月的月份序列 LEFT JOIN 聚合结果。\n\nSQL:\n\nWITH months AS (\n  SELECT generate_series(DATE '2018-01-01', DATE '2018-12-01', INTERVAL '1 month')::date AS m\n),\nmau AS (\n  SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', o.order_purchase_timestamp)::date AS m,\n         COUNT(DISTINCT c.customer_unique_id) AS mau\n  FROM orders o\n  JOIN customers c ON c.customer_id = o.customer_id\n  WHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled','unavailable')\n    AND o.order_purchase_timestamp >= TIMESTAMP '2018-01-01'\n    AND o.order_purchase_timestamp < TIMESTAMP '2019-01-01'\n  GROUP BY 1\n)\nSELECT EXTRACT(MONTH FROM mo.m)::int AS month, ma.mau\nFROM months mo LEFT JOIN mau ma ON ma.m = mo.m\nORDER BY 1;\n\n但要求只输出一条SELECT？硬规则1说只输出一条SELECT。WITH 里算一条SELECT。可以接受吗？通常是的。不过为保险可以写成单条SELECT加子查询。\n\n输出列：月份和MAU。应按指标，输出12行。month 用 EXTRACT(MONTH...)::int。\n\n也可以写成：\n\nSELECT EXTRACT(MONTH FROM mo.m)::int AS month, ma.mau\nFROM generate_series(...) ...\n\n用子查询写：\n\nSELECT EXTRACT(MONTH FROM mo.m)::int AS month, ma.mau\nFROM (SELECT generate_series(DATE '2018-01-01', DATE '2018-12-01', INTERVAL '1 month')::date AS m) mo\nLEFT JOIN (\n  SELECT DATE_TRUNC('month', o.order_purchase_timestamp)::date AS m, COUNT(DISTINCT c.customer_unique_id) AS mau\n  FROM orders o\n  JOIN customers c ON c.customer_id = o.customer_id\n  WHERE o.order_status NOT IN ('canceled','unavailable')\n    AND o.order_purchase_timestamp >= TIMESTAMP '2018-01-01'\n    AND o.order_purchase_timestamp < TIMESTAMP '2019-01-01'\n  GROUP BY 1\n) ma ON ma.m = mo.m\nORDER BY 1;\n\nLIMIT 需要吗？规则3：必须LIMIT，但单行无GROUP BY的COUNT/SUM/AVG除外。这里有GROUP BY，有12行。为安全加 LIMIT 12。但是ORDER BY后加LIMIT 12不改变结果。可以加。\n\n输出应包含月份数字。好的。\n\n日期类型：DATE '2018-01-01' 作为date literal。generate_series 与 INTERVAL 返回 timestamp，::date 转换。\n\nDATE_TRUNC('month', timestamp) 返回 timestamp，::date 转为月首日，匹配。好的。\n\n最终 SQL。加 LIMIT 12。"},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":3842,"completion_tokens":927,"total_tokens":4769,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1792},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":734},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1792,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":2050},"system_fingerprint":"bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}